   "quote": "attached with the AWS-managed AmazonECSTaskExecutionRolePolicy"
  }
 ],
 "notes": "Trust-policy branches bind Allow + sts:AssumeRole + the ecs-tasks principal to one statement (planned JSON is key-sorted) and are tied to the role named ecsTaskExecutionRole; the attachment may reference the role or name it literally."
